# 💳 Credit Scoring Model — CodeAlpha ML Internship

> **Task 1 — Predict an individual's creditworthiness using past financial data.**

---

## 📌 Project Overview

This project builds a **Credit Scoring Model** that predicts whether a person is likely to default on a loan based on their financial history. Built as part of the **CodeAlpha Machine Learning Internship**.

---

## 📊 Dataset

- **Name:** Give Me Some Credit
- **Source:** [Kaggle Competition](https://www.kaggle.com/c/GiveMeSomeCredit)
- **Size:** 150,000 rows × 11 features
- **Target:** `SeriousDlqin2yrs` (1 = Default, 0 = No Default)
- **Class Imbalance:** 93.32% No Default vs 6.68% Default

