---

## 💡 Key Insights

- **RevolvingUtilizationOfUnsecuredLines** was the most important feature
- **NumberOfTimes90DaysLate** was 2nd most important
- Banks prioritize **Recall over Precision** — missing a real defaulter is more costly than a false alarm
- Low precision (~15-20%) is expected and acceptable given 6.68% default rate in real financial datasets

